\ === the Corner ===

\ one leaf of a pair of swinging doors in a wall facing south, from x0 to x1: the leaf, its round window and its kick plate
: swinging-door-leaf ( x0 x1 z height -- )
	| x0 x1 z height |
	[ [ x0 0 z ] [ x1 0 z ] [ x1 height z ] [ x0 height z ] ] to leaf
	leaf 0 fill
	pen to leaf-light
	leaf outline
	x0 x1 + 2 / to middle
	leaf-light 1.2 * pen!
	[ middle 1.55 z 0.01 - ] [ 1 0 0 ] [ 0 1 0 ] 0.17 16 circle-points to porthole
	porthole 0.03 fill
	porthole outline
	[ middle 1.55 z 0.01 - ] [ 1 0 0 ] [ 0 1 0 ] 0.13 16 circle-points outline
	leaf-light 0.9 * pen!
	[ [ x0 0.06 + 0.03 z 0.01 - ] [ x1 0.06 - 0.03 z 0.01 - ] [ x1 0.06 - 0.3 z 0.01 - ] [ x0 0.06 + 0.3 z 0.01 - ] ] outline
	leaf-light pen! ;

